          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 81 SE 5/20 ASTON CLINTON LONDON ROAD (south side) Stable Block N. of Rookery House (Formerly listed as Stable Block N. of Rookery Park House) 25.10.51 GV II Stables and coachhouse, now garage. C18, red brick, hipped tiled roof, dentil brick eaves, dormer to W. roofslope, gabled loft entrance on N. side, 1 storey and loft, W. elevation has central door flanked by 2-light casements, S. elevation has 2 garage doors and one stable door, all with segmental brick arches, W. end has 1 bay blank recess, N. elevation has 3 windows and 1 recess with segmental arches and 2 inserted casements. Listing NGR: SP8770112006"
    }
